<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Mutation Testing Report</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 20px; }
        .header { background: #f5f5f5; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px; }
        .score { font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #dc3545; }
        table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-top: 20px; }
        th, td { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px; text-align: left; }
        th { background-color: #f2f2f2; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>Mutation Testing Report</h1>
        <div class="score">Overall Score: 50.0%</div>
        <p>Score formula: (killed + timed out) / (total - not viable - errors)</p>
        <p>Quality Gate: FAILED - Mutation score below minimum threshold</p>
    </div>
    <h2>Summary</h2>
    <p>Total Mutants: 100</p>
    <p>Killed: 50</p>
    <p>Timed out: 0</p>
    <p>Not viable: 0</p>
    <p>Errors: 0</p>
    <p>Files Analyzed: 1</p>
    <h2>File Details</h2>
    <table>
        <tr>
            <th>File</th>
            <th>Total Mutants</th>
            <th>Killed</th>
            <th>Timed Out</th>
            <th>Not Viable</th>
            <th>Errors</th>
            <th>Score</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>example.go</td>
            <td>100</td>
            <td>50</td>
            <td>0</td>
            <td>0</td>
            <td>0</td>
            <td>50.0%</td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>
</html>